  "note": "All analyses use records intended to derive from seed 42. Where a source file carries records_seed metadata that value was checked (seed_verified_sources); older files without the field are listed under seed_unverified_sources, so their provenance is externally supplied rather than verified from the JSON. Cross-corpus differences were not tested across multiple training seeds. Step 3 retrieval recall is deliberately excluded from these tables: on SciFact it is cited-document recall over all 300 claims, on SciFact-Open it is evidence recall over the 206 evidenced claims, so the two are not the same measurement. The Q2 layers are kept separate because the automatic signals are proxies, not taxonomy labels, and only SciFact carries manual category labels. The comparison therefore describes the seed-42 run and does not establish stability across training seeds."
